.sp
.ne 5
.ft B
9. Final Conclusion
.br
.ft R
Qwen is better for this financial query pipeline. Its strengths are higher answer
.br
correctness, more usable partial answers, stronger SPARQL/scan performance, and fewer
.br
scan-stage failures. Llama can still produce a plausible DAG, but its SPARQL execution
.br
and final factual correctness are much weaker in this retest.
.br
Use the PDF for easy explanation and the per-query audit CSV to check every query one by
.br
one.
.br
